{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1f013f6426b27f8cb555c22229b6c039f0c3bf25e128f377b49ae37cdbaeeacb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconcile bridge outbound comment sync","key_entities":["REB-1861","REB-1580","REB-1829","RECONCILER_MARKER","outbound_comments._normalize_comment_body","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","comment_ids","irongrey-chubby-oxpecker","bd80-0603-7d44-4d9f","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","cleanup.py","GitHub Actions run 32403944666"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira sync","comment dedup","reconcile bridge","data cleanup"],"propositions":["The Jira reconcile bridge re-posted identical comments on every hourly pass because the primary comment-id dedup map was inert/empty, accumulating 30,847 duplicate bot-authored comments across 30 Jira issues and causing REB-1861 to hit the 5000-comment hard cap.","29,931 duplicate bot comments were irreversibly deleted across 27 of 30 affected issues using a keep-oldest-per-distinct-normalized-body rule, reducing REB-1861 from 5000 to 79 comments and clearing the cap blockage.","836 unmarked comments across three issues (REB-1567, REB-1931, REB-2605) authored by the same bot but lacking the reconciler marker due to outbound truncation at 32767 chars were deliberately excluded from phase 1 and left for phase 2 review behind --include-truncated.","Every deletion was preceded by a full pre-deletion backup per issue (150MB total), paginated fetch completeness validation, dry-run inspection, single-issue canary verification, and post-deletion independent verification showing zero missing distinct bodies.","The reconcile-bridge workflow remained paused throughout the operation and was not re-enabled, with rate-limit handling absorbing 713+ throttles across 29,931 DELETE operations with zero failures."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787288199654955001,"uuid":"dce12660-b304-43bd-af6f-c42d7ebfa52b"}